## Methodology

For every stream with finite exponential decay, the half-life is multiplied by
(1 + {{ variation_factor }}) and (1 − {{ variation_factor }}) while all other
streams are held constant. The MEEV scores are recomputed and the top-supported
and top-opposed conclusions are compared against the baseline.
